{%- comment -%}
  "Gift card created" notification – email body.

  Campaign switch: gift cards issued by the gift-card-promo tool carry
  template_suffix = "gift-card-promo" (GIFT_CARD_TEMPLATE_SUFFIX in .env). Those get the
  promo version below, which never shows the amount. Gift cards created any other
  way (issued by hand in the admin, bought in the store) have no suffix and get
  the original email unchanged.

  Reminders are sent separately with Shopify Email, so this template has one promo
  copy only. Every date in it comes from the card's expiry (gift_card.expires_on).

  The suffix must match in three places: .env, the notification templates
  (subject + this body) and the theme's templates/gift_card.gift-card-promo.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign promo_suffix = 'gift-card-promo' -%}
{%- assign is_promo = false -%}
{%- if gift_card.template_suffix == promo_suffix -%}{%- assign is_promo = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign promo_long_date = '' -%}{%- assign promo_short_date = '' -%}
{%- if gift_card.expires_on -%}
{%- capture promo_long_date -%}{{ gift_card.expires_on | date: '%B %-d, %Y' }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture promo_short_date -%}{{ gift_card.expires_on | date: '%-m/%-d/%Y' }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign promo_name = '' -%}
{%- if gift_card.customer and gift_card.customer.first_name != blank -%}{%- assign promo_name = gift_card.customer.first_name -%}{%- endif -%}

{% if is_promo %}
{% capture email_title %}{% endcapture %}
{% capture email_body %}<p>Hello{% if promo_name != '' %} {{ promo_name }}{% endif %},</p>
<p>We did some "Balloon Math" and found some funds for you!</p>
<p>Don't let your money go to waste!<br>
You have an <strong>unused credit</strong> at <strong>LA Balloons</strong> waiting for you!<br>
It’s yours to use at <a href="{{ shop.url }}">LABalloons.com</a>{% if promo_long_date != '' %}, but you must use it or lose it by <strong>{{ promo_long_date }}</strong>{% endif %}.</p>
<p>Click below to claim your credit code before it's gone:</p>{% endcapture %}
{% capture button_text %}Claim My Credit Now{% endcapture %}
{% capture email_after %}<p style="font-size: 12px;">** Promotional reward only. No cash value. Not redeemable for cash, non-transferable, valid only at <a href="{{ shop.url }}">laballoons.com</a>{% if promo_short_date != '' %} &amp; expires {{ promo_short_date }}{% endif %}. **</p>
<p>No strings attached!<br>
Shop now and apply your code before it’s too late!</p>
<p>We appreciate your business, and thank you for trusting us with your balloon and party supply needs!<br>
Your support means the world to our team.</p>
<p>- LA Balloons</p>
<p style="font-size: 12px;"><strong>** Terms &amp; Conditions:</strong><br>
This voucher is distributed entirely for free as part of a temporary marketing promotion; no monetary value or thing of value was paid in exchange for it. Valid only for merchandise online at <a href="{{ shop.url }}">www.laballoons.com</a>. This code cannot be redeemed for cash, and is explicitly exempt from California’s mandatory gift certificate cash-out regulations. Lost, deleted, or stolen promotional codes will not be replaced.{% if promo_short_date != '' %} Expires on {{ promo_short_date }}.{% endif %}</p>{% endcapture %}
{% else %}
{% capture email_title %}Your Online Credit Code is now available! {% endcapture %}
{% capture email_body %}<center>Hi{% if gift_card.customer %} {{ gift_card.customer.first_name }}{% endif %}, here is your {{ gift_card.balance | money_without_trailing_zeros }} online credit code.<br><br>Treat this code like cash and save this email for future reference.</center>{% endcapture %}
{% capture button_text %}View your Online Credit Code{% endcapture %}
{% capture email_after %}{% endcapture %}
{% endif %}
<!-- promo-stage: {% if is_promo %}promo{% else %}original{% endif %} -->

<!DOCTYPE html>
